<title>USA: FNB Corp ups div to $0.18/shr.</title>
<headline>FNB Corp ups div to $0.18/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ASHEBORO, N.C. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>FNB Corp said on Monday that it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.18 per share from $0.15 a share and set a special dividend of $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>Both the quarterly and special dividends would be payable on January 20, 1997, to shareholders of record on December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>FNB, the bank holding company for First National Bank and Trust Company, operates 11 offices in Chatham, Montgomery and Randolph counties in central North Carolina.</p>
<p>- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
